#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:-1
msgid "Kdenlive Documentation - Project Bin - Generators"
msgstr "Документация Kdenlive — Корзина проекта — Генераторы"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:-1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, add clips, generator, counter, color bars, white noise, "
"editing, timeline, documentation, user manual, video editor, open source, "
"free, learn, easy"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, добавление клипов, генератор, счётчик, цветовые полосы, белый "
"шум, редактирование, монтажный стол, документация, руководство пользователя, "
"видеоредактор, открытый исходный код, свободное ПО, обучение, простотата"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:24
msgid "Generators"
msgstr "Генераторы"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:26
msgid ""
"As the name suggests, **Generators** generate a short video clip or still "
"images for specific purposes. Many of you will recognize them from the good "
"old days of bulky TV sets."
msgstr ""
"Как следует из названия, **генераторы** создают короткий видеоклип или "
"неподвижные изображения для определённых целей. Многие помнят их по старым "
"добрым временам громоздких телевизоров."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:35
msgid "Using generators"
msgstr "Использование генераторов"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:37
msgid "There are three generators available:"
msgstr "Доступны три генератора:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:39
msgid "`Counter`_"
msgstr "`Counter`_"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:41
msgid "`Color Bars`_"
msgstr "`Цветные полосы`_"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:43
msgid "`White Noise`_"
msgstr "`Белый шум`_"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:49
msgid "Counter"
msgstr "Счётчик"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:51
msgid "This generates a counter timer video clip in various formats."
msgstr "Создаёт видеоклип со счётчиком времени в различных форматах."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:58
msgid "Counter generator"
msgstr "Генератор счётчика"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:63
msgid ":guilabel:`Count up`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Отсчёт вперёд`:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:63
msgid ""
"You can choose to have the clip count up by checking that option, otherwise "
"it will count down."
msgstr ""
"Если установить этот флажок, счёт в клипе будет идти вверх, иначе — вниз."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:68
msgid ":guilabel:`No Background`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Без фона`:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:68
msgid ""
"This option will remove the black lines and the white circles from the "
"counter leaving only the grey background."
msgstr ""
"Этот параметр убирает у счётчика чёрные линии и белые круги, оставляя только "
"серый фон."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:71
msgid "Choose the display style for the counter"
msgstr "Выберите стиль отображения счётчика"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:73
msgid "Seconds to 1 (default)"
msgstr "Секунды до 1 (по умолчанию)"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:74
msgid "Seconds to 0"
msgstr "Секунды до 0"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:75
msgid "Frames"
msgstr "Кадры"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:76
msgid "Timecode"
msgstr "Тайм-код"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:77
msgid ":guilabel:`Counter Style`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Тип счётчика`:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:77
msgid "Clock"
msgstr "Часы"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:80
msgid "Choose whether and what sound to playback"
msgstr "Выберите, воспроизводить ли звук и какой именно"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:82
msgid "Silent"
msgstr "Без звука"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:83
msgid "1 kHz before end"
msgstr "1 кГц перед окончанием"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:84
msgid ":guilabel:`Sound`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Звук`:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:84
msgid "1 kHz each second"
msgstr "1 кГц каждую секунду"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:86
msgid ":guilabel:`Drop frame timecode`: .. .. to be documented"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Тайм-код с пропуском кадров`: .. .. будет описано позже"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:89
msgid ""
"To change the size and position of the clip, you can add an effect to the "
"clip on the timeline or in the project bin such as the :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/"
"position_and_zoom` or the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"transform_distort_perspective/transform`."
msgstr ""
"Чтобы изменить размер и положение клипа, можно добавить к клипу на монтажном "
"столе или в корзине проекта такой эффект, как :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/position_and_zoom` или :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/transform`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:93
msgid "Color Bars"
msgstr "Цветные полосы"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:97
msgid "Generates a color test pattern of various types."
msgstr "Создаёт испытательную цветную таблицу различных типов."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:104
msgid "Color Bars generator"
msgstr "Генератор цветных полос"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:108
msgid ":guilabel:`Bar Type`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Тип таблицы`:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:110
msgid "PAL color bars"
msgstr "Цветные полосы PAL"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:111
msgid "PAL color bars with red"
msgstr "Цветные полосы PAL с красным"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:112
msgid "BBC color bars"
msgstr "Цветные полосы BBC"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:113
msgid "EBU color bars"
msgstr "Цветные полосы EBU"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:114
msgid "SMPTE color bars"
msgstr "Цветные полосы SMPTE"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:115
msgid "Philips PM5544"
msgstr "Philips PM5544"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:116
msgid "FuBK"
msgstr "FuBK"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:117
msgid "Simplified FuBK"
msgstr "Упрощённый FuBK"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:121
msgid "White Noise"
msgstr "Белый шум"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/generators.rst:126
msgid ""
"This generates a video noise clip - like the \"snow\" on an out-of-tune "
"analogue TV including the audio white noise"
msgstr ""
"Создаёт видеоклип с шумом — как «снег» на расстроенном аналоговом "
"телевизоре, включая белый шум в звуке"
